# t5 — range fixture (mirrors demos/13-typed-registries/137-range-clamp.bqn)
# hp keeps the untyped double carrier; the declared range clamps writes into 0..100.
# The default must sit inside the range (the load seal), so it is declared first.
n 4
col alive bool 1 1 1 1
col hp num 50.5 80 20 95
default hp 10
range hp 0 100
